#. Diagram label
msgid "How did it end?"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/dsa-document-lifecycle.bpmn:294
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Is there an ODRL Agreement for this version? `yes`: it must cite the text by URL and hash. `document only`: go straight to publishing."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/dsa-document-lifecycle.bpmn:216
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Legal and policy review of the whole draft. Reviewers comment on blocks through review-comments; review says which review skill answers which question. For a consent-based agreement the reviewers also check that the plain-language summary says what the text says, since it is what the person consents to (consent rule 3)."
msgstr ""

