msgid "Merge: with or without new consent, the new version is written and published again (P1, P2). Its DCAT 3 record carries dcat:previousVersion naming the fixed-version URL of the version it amends (P2.4–5, dsa-dcat-record); older Consents are carried across a narrowing amendment along that chain."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/dsa-document-lifecycle.bpmn:234
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Merge: with or without public comment, the reviewers then decide whether the draft is ready to sign."
